{
 "task_id": "web-word-universe",
 "prompts": [
  "Words are tied to each other, and nobody here can see how. {WS}/site is a saved copy of a Portuguese creative dictionary. Explore this universe of words: collect what the site knows and build {WS}/universe/index.html, a single file that sums the universe up in one view and lets someone search for a word and find how it relates to others. The best way to show it is your call, and that view is what we care about most. So people can share a word, opening the page with ?word=saudade must show that word and its relations. Save the data as {WS}/words.json, mapping each word to the words it is linked to, and record in {WS}/result.json: words (how many), relations (how many distinct pairs) and most_connected. It is reviewed by opening the file, with no build step, in a browser that reaches only Google Fonts and https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js."
 ],
 "answers": [
  "[goal] Build a searchable, shareable map of the dictionary.\n\n[action] Created `universe/index.html`, `words.json`, and `result.json`. Assumed only “Sinônimos” and “Palavras análogas” define relations; navigation, footer links, and broken references were excluded. Relations are undirected.\n\n[result] Found **252 words**, **734 distinct pairs**, and **palavra** as most connected with **16 links**, alphabetically winning a tie with **tempo**. The interactive canvas supports search, direct node selection, related-word navigation, and `?word=saudade` deep links.\n\n[next] Verified the finished file directly in the browser with `?word=saudade`: it displayed all five expected relations, correct accents, and the measured totals. Browser tabs were closed."
 ],
 "diff": "A build.py\nA result.json\nA template.html\nA tmp/themes.json\nA universe/index.html\nA words.json\n\n--- build.py ---\nimport pathlib,re,json,html\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nsite=pathlib.Path('site'); words={}; themes={}\nfor p in site.glob('*.html'):\n s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\n m=re.search(r'<main>.*?<h1>(.*?)</h1>(.*?)</main>',s,re.S|re.I)\n if not m: continue\n w=html.unescape(re.sub('<[^>]+>','',m.group(1))).strip().lower()\n if w=='dicionário criativo': continue\n words.setdefault(w,set())\n tm=re.search(r'class=\"tema\">Tema:\\s*([^<]+)',m.group(2),re.I)\n if tm: themes[w]=html.unescape(tm.group(1)).strip()\n for sec in re.findall(r'<section id=\"(?:sinonimos|analogas)\".*?</section>',m.group(2),re.S|re.I):\n  for a in re.findall(r'<a\\b[^>]*>(.*?)</a>',sec,re.S|re.I):\n   v=html.unescape(re.sub('<[^>]+>','',a)).strip().lower()\n   if v!=w: words[w].add(v)\n# keep links to collected dictionary entries, make symmetric\nwords={w:{v for v in vs if v in words} for w,vs in words.items()}\nfor w,vs in list(words.items()):\n for v in vs: words[v].add(w)\ndata={w:sorted(words[w]) for w in sorted(words)}\npairs={tuple(sorted((w,v))) for w,vs in data.items() for v in vs}\nrank=sorted(data,key=lambda w:(-len(data[w]),w))\npathlib.Path('words.json').write_text(json.dumps(data,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')\npathlib.Path('result.json').write_text(json.dumps({'words':len(data),'relations':len(pairs),'most_connected':rank[0]},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')\npathlib.Path('tmp').mkdir(exist_ok=True)\npathlib.Path('tmp/themes.json').write_text(json.dumps(themes,ensure_ascii=False),encoding='utf-8')\nprint(len(data),len(pairs),rank[:5],[(w,len(data[w])) for w in rank[:5]])\n\n\n--- result.json ---\n{\r\n  \"words\": 252,\r\n  \"relations\": 734,\r\n  \"most_connected\": \"palavra\"\r\n}\n\n--- template.html ---\n<!doctype html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Entrelinhas — universo de palavras</title><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"><link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;1,500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"><style>\n:root{--ink:#f2eee4;--muted:#aaa99f;--gold:#e9bd74;--bg:#111c1b}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;overflow:hidden}body:before{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 40%,#28403b88,transparent 45%);pointer-events:none}header{height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 34px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff12;position:relative;z-index:3}.brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}.mark{width:37px;height:37px;border:1px solid var(--gold);border-radius:50%;position:relative}.mark:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:5px;height:5px;background:var(--gold);border-radius:50%;left:15px;top:15px;box-shadow:-13px -9px 0 -1px var(--gold),13px 9px 0 -1px var(--gold)}h1{font:600 24px 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:0}header p{margin:3px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}.stats{display:flex;gap:36px}.stat b{font:500 25px 'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--gold)}.stat span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:1.4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:3px}main{height:calc(100vh - 100px);position:relative}#map{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;cursor:grab}.searchbox{position:absolute;left:34px;top:27px;width:min(390px,calc(100% - 68px));z-index:4}.search{height:55px;background:#f3efe7;color:#1c2926;display:flex;align-items:center;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 8px 35px #0004}.search span{font-size:22px;padding:0 15px}.search input{border:0;outline:0;background:none;font:15px 'DM Sans';width:100%;color:#1c2926}.search kbd{margin-right:14px;color:#8c8d85;border:1px solid #ccc8bd;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px}.hint{font-size:11px;color:#c0c4ba;margin:11px 0 0 4px;letter-spacing:.4px}#suggestions{display:none;background:#f3efe7;color:#1c2926;margin-top:5px;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}#suggestions button{display:block;width:100%;border:0;background:none;text-align:left;padding:10px 16px;font:14px 'DM Sans';cursor:pointer}#suggestions button:hover{background:#ded8cb}.panel{position:absolute;right:32px;top:28px;width:295px;max-height:calc(100% - 65px);overflow:auto;background:#152321ee;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border:1px solid #ffffff1a;padding:25px;z-index:2;box-shadow:0 18px 50px #0003}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--gold);text-transform:uppercase}.panel h2{font:italic 500 38px 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:9px 0 6px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.panel .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:23px}.relations{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}.relations button{border:1px solid #ffffff24;background:#ffffff07;color:#e8e7df;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:20px;cursor:pointer;font:12px 'DM Sans'}.relations button:hover{border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--gold)}.share{margin-top:24px;border:0;background:var(--gold);color:#17231f;padding:11px 16px;font:600 12px 'DM Sans';cursor:pointer;width:100%}.close{position:absolute;right:14px;top:12px;background:none;border:0;color:#aaa;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}.legend{position:absolute;bottom:25px;left:34px;font-size:10px;color:#a7aea5;letter-spacing:.6px;pointer-events:none}.legend i{display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);margin-right:8px}.reset{position:absolute;bottom:24px;right:32px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #ffffff26;color:#ccc;padding:8px 13px;font:11px 'DM Sans';cursor:pointer}#toast{position:absolute;bottom:25px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:var(--ink);color\n[... 7116 chars cut by the benchmark]\n\n--- tmp/themes.json ---\n{\"acento\": \"linguag